  m_text: 'Before we begin...


    This project is an alpha version, representing
    more a proof of concept and technical demonstration, rather than a finalized
    or commercial game.

    Its primary goal is to showcase and evaluate on-device
    local AI inference (running a language model entirely on mobile hardware without
    relying on external services .)



    As an experimental prototype, the assets,
    gameplay pacing, and generation times reflect the current boundaries and challenges
    of running edge AI on mobile devices. Please view this project as an exploratory
    look into what local AI can achieve on mobile hardware today, rather than a finished
    gaming experience.'
