    - target: {fileID: 2979656831496579133, guid: b7ab0eb2b92012d48aa228e3efd33729, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _systemPrompt
      value: "You are a game engine for a medieval survival game. Define several
        event actions based on the game rules.\n\nGAME RULES:\n- Action: Under 5
        words.\n- Satiety: Physical effort = DECREASED. Eating = INCREASED, Else
        = NO CHANGE\n- Progression: Moving to exit = INCREASED. Stuck/Trap = DECREASED,
        Else = NO CHANGE\n- Ended  : If it resolves the event = YES, Else = NO  \n-
        itemCollected : Name of the item took by player, else None."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4470054557326383295, guid: b7ab0eb2b92012d48aa228e3efd33729, type: 3}
